            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life and Education</strong><br>\nRichard Dawkins was born in Nairobi, Kenya, in 1941. He moved to England at eight years old when his family relocated. Dawkins exhibited an early interest in the natural world, which laid the groundwork for his future studies. He attended Oundle School before moving on to study zoology at Balliol College, Oxford. Under the tutelage of Nobel Prize-winning ethologist Nikolaas Tinbergen, Dawkins earned his degree and began a path that would lead him to become a prominent evolutionary biologist.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Scientific Career and Research</strong><br>\nDawkins began his scientific career with a focus on animal behavior and evolutionary biology. He gained prominence with his first book, \"The Selfish Gene,\" published in 1976, which popularized the gene-centered view of evolution. This book introduced the term \"meme\" to describe how cultural information spreads. His subsequent research continued to explore the themes of evolution, genetics, and animal behavior, influencing the way these subjects are understood.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Selfish Gene</strong><br>\nThe Selfish Gene is Dawkins's most famous work and has been influential in shaping public understanding of evolution. The book argues that the gene is the principal unit of selection in evolution and that organisms can be viewed as 'vehicles' for genes. Dawkins's clear and persuasive writing style helped to popularize the idea that genes are selfish entities, working to ensure their own survival.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
